QMK patch: a joystick interface with a custom HID report descriptor.

Lets a keymap replace QMK's joystick report descriptor (JOYSTICK_REPORT_DESCRIPTOR),
keep the joystick on its own interface and endpoint with no report ID
(JOYSTICK_OWN_EP = yes), set its endpoint size and polling interval, and receive the
output and feature reports the host sends with SET_REPORT (joystick_receive_report).
Feature reads (GET_REPORT) return the last feature report set, or what the keymap set
with joystick_set_feature_reply. ChibiOS (ARM) boards only.

Made against qmk_firmware master 7a1bbf37c5c07da4ea0a162bb139083a46ef40a1
(2026-10-02). Apply from the root of your QMK checkout:

    git apply /path/to/0001-joystick-custom-hid-interface.patch

